        "Just like Set, but uses == instead of = for comparisons",
        "LiteralDictionaries check not only for equality but also for same class of their keys.\r\nThis avoids the problem of 0 being considered = to 0.0 as in Dictionaries, and it\r\nalso avoids the problem of 1.3 not being == to 1.3 (necessarily), as in IdentityDictionaries.",
